## 🔁 Revised Priority Plan

### Phase 1: "Game Loop Closes" (~1 day)
Before a complete session is possible:

1. **[B2] Wire hero movement** — Tile click in move mode → [moveHero()](file:///c:/antigravity/ravenloft/src/store/gameStore.ts#263-287) with adjacency check
2. **[B3] Wire monster attacks** — Monster click in attack mode → [attackMonster()](file:///c:/antigravity/ravenloft/src/store/gameStore.ts#288-319)
3. **[B1] Win/Loss detection** — After [endTurn()](file:///c:/antigravity/ravenloft/src/store/gameStore.ts#373-418), check objective + hero HP/surges
4. **[B4] Gate exploration arrows** — Only respond during hero phase

### Phase 2: "Session Feels Complete" (~half day)
5. **[P1-C] Hero ability UI** — Click a card → [usePower()](file:///c:/antigravity/ravenloft/src/store/gameStore.ts#419-447) with targeting
6. **[P1-D] Healing surge button** — Spend surges from HeroPanel
7. **[P1-B] Fix RotationPicker** — Pass actual valid rotations from FSM
8. **[P1-A] Style deck-exhausted modal** — Gothic panel

### Phase 3: "Content Feels Rich" (~1-2 days)
9. Add ~23 power cards to [powerCards.json](file:///c:/antigravity/ravenloft/src/data/powerCards.json)
10. Add Coffin Token interaction system
11. Add remaining hero ability cards

